      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::chunk::000::abstract::f895614108"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded HEA microstructure can progressively adjust the effective coefficient of thermal expansion across the joint.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded refractory HEA can act as a physical and chemical diffusion barrier between W and CuCrZr.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A smooth gradient in thermo-mechanical properties reduces the thermal-expansion mismatch between W and CuCrZr.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing the thermal-expansion mismatch lowers induced interfacial stresses.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded HEA interlayer prevents deleterious interdiffusion and interfacial reaction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded HEA interlayer improves bonding at the W/CuCrZr interface.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded HEA interlayer reduces thermal-stress accumulation and interdiffusion relative to direct W/CuCrZr bonding.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded HEA interlayer enhances joint durability and performance under fusion-reactor conditions.",
